## 5. What would change my answer to "ready"

- FE II: Wave 0 + Wave 1 complete, Unit 2 forged, hours closing at 10/30/14 in both courses.
- Research: consent administered by the IP, DPO sign-off in hand, rubric frozen.
- Publishing: `git push` — nine commits are unpushed, so **nothing above is live for students yet**.

That last one is a one-command gap and the cheapest win on this page.
